+/* Fixed native IB8 + no-IRQ CACHE_FLUSH_TS + WHERE continuation at20->32.
+ * EOP is a distinct GPU-written normal DATA word. Capture all1024 zeros,
+ * copy/compare IB8 and ring12 only, submit, wait device32/idle AND bounded
